#, no-wrap
msgid "[Sample-based quantum diagonalization](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/addons/qiskit-addon-sqd), and [Sample-based quantum diagonalization of a chemistry Hamiltonian](/tutorials/sample-based-quantum-diagonalization), the electronic-structure counterpart of this tutorial.\n"
